This chapter shares only terrain, map width, map height, person, person ahead, feature, feature ahead, counter, column ahead, row ahead, conversation column, conversation row and travel.

Use the foundation chapter.

The map dimensions are width and height, in that order:
  "Bedroom" has 8 and 8.
  "Home" has 8 and 8.
  "Pallet Town" has 20 and 18.
  "Oak's Lab" has 10 and 12.
  "Route 1" has 20 and 36.
  "Viridian City" has 40 and 36.
  "Viridian Mart" has 8 and 8.
  "Viridian Center" has 14 and 8.
  "Route 2" has 20 and 72.
  "Forest South Gate" has 10 and 8.
  "Viridian Forest" has 34 and 48.
  "Forest North Gate" has 10 and 8.
  "Pewter City" has 40 and 36.
  "Pewter Gym" has 10 and 14.
  "Route 22" has 40 and 18.
  "Route 22 Gate" has 10 and 8.
  "Pewter Center" has 14 and 8.
  "Pewter Mart" has 8 and 8.
  "Blue's House" has 8 and 8.
  "Viridian School" has 8 and 8.
  "Viridian House" has 8 and 8.
  "Pewter House" has 8 and 8.
  "Nidoran House" has 8 and 8.

To work out the map width (number):
  Let the dimension be the map dimensions for Journey's place.
  The answer is the dimension's width or else 0.

To work out the map height (number):
  Let the dimension be the map dimensions for Journey's place.
  The answer is the dimension's height or else 0.

