    For "Oak's Lab:6,3", use "Charmander".
    For "Oak's Lab:7,3", use "Squirtle".
    For "Oak's Lab:8,3", use "Bulbasaur".
    For "Viridian Mart:0,5" or "Pewter Mart:0,5", use "Clerk".
    For "Viridian Center:3,1" or "Pewter Center:3,1", use "Nurse".
    For "Viridian Forest:30,33", use "Bug Catcher 1".
    For "Viridian Forest:30,19", use "Bug Catcher 2".
    For "Viridian Forest:2,18", use "Bug Catcher 3".
