  "Pewter Center:3,7" has "Pewter City", 13 and 26.
  "Pewter Center:4,7" has "Pewter City", 13 and 26.
  "Pewter City:23,17" has "Pewter Mart", 3 and 6.
  "Pewter Mart:3,7" has "Pewter City", 23 and 18.
  "Pewter Mart:4,7" has "Pewter City", 23 and 18.
  "Route 22:8,5" has "Route 22 Gate", 4 and 6.
  "Route 22 Gate:4,7" has "Route 22", 8 and 6.
  "Route 22 Gate:5,7" has "Route 22", 8 and 6.

To cross:
  Let the key be the position key at Journey's column by Journey's row.
  Let the doorway be the doorways for the key.
  If the doorway is nothing:
    Stop.
  Set Journey's place to the doorway's arrival place.
  Set Journey's column to the doorway's arrival column.
  Set Journey's row to the doorway's arrival row.

To travel a direction (text):
  Let the column be Journey's column.
  Let the row be Journey's row.
  If the direction is "north" or the direction is "up":
    Set Journey's facing to "north".
    Subtract 1 from the row.
  Otherwise if the direction is "south" or the direction is "down":
    Set Journey's facing to "south".
    Add 1 to the row.
  Otherwise if the direction is "west" or the direction is "left":
    Set Journey's facing to "west".
    Subtract 1 from the column.
  Otherwise if the direction is "east" or the direction is "right":
    Set Journey's facing to "east".
    Add 1 to the column.
  Otherwise:
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Pallet Town" and the row is less than 0 and ((the column is at least 0 and the column is at most 2) or (the column is at least 4 and the column is at most 8) or (the column is at least 10 and the column is at most 11) or (the column is at least 13 and the column is at most 17) or (the column is at least 19 and the column is at most 19)):
    Set Journey's place to "Route 1".
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to the map height - 1.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Route 1" and the row is at least the map height and ((the column is at least 0 and the column is at most 2) or (the column is at least 4 and the column is at most 8) or (the column is at least 10 and the column is at most 11) or (the column is at least 13 and the column is at most 17) or (the column is at least 19 and the column is at most 19)):
    Set Journey's place to "Pallet Town".
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to 0.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Route 1" and the row is less than 0 and ((the column is at least 0 and the column is at most 2) or (the column is at least 4 and the column is at most 8) or (the column is at least 10 and the column is at most 11) or (the column is at least 13 and the column is at most 17) or (the column is at least 19 and the column is at most 19)):
    Set Journey's place to "Viridian City".
    Add 10 to the column.
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to the map height - 1.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Viridian City" and the row is at least the map height and ((the column is at least 10 and the column is at most 12) or (the column is at least 14 and the column is at most 18) or (the column is at least 20 and the column is at most 21) or (the column is at least 23 and the column is at most 27) or (the column is at least 29 and the column is at most 29)):
    Set Journey's place to "Route 1".
    Subtract 10 from the column.
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to 0.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Viridian City" and the row is less than 0 and the column is at least 17 and the column is at most 19:
    Set Journey's place to "Route 2".
    Subtract 10 from the column.
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to the map height - 1.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Route 2" and the row is at least the map height and the column is at least 7 and the column is at most 9:
    Set Journey's place to "Viridian City".
    Add 10 to the column.
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to 0.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Route 2" and the row is less than 0 and ((the column is at least 0 and the column is at most 1) or (the column is at least 8 and the column is at most 9) or (the column is at least 16 and the column is at most 19)):
    Set Journey's place to "Pewter City".
    Add 10 to the column.
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to the map height - 1.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Pewter City" and the row is at least the map height and the column is at least 18 and the column is at most 19:
    Set Journey's place to "Route 2".
    Subtract 10 from the column.
    Set Journey's column to the column.
    Set Journey's row to 0.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Viridian City" and the column is less than 0 and the row is at least 14 and the row is at most 17:
    Set Journey's place to "Route 22".
    Subtract 8 from the row.
    Set Journey's row to the row.
    Set Journey's column to the map width - 1.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Route 22" and the column is at least the map width and the row is at least 6 and the row is at most 9:
    Set Journey's place to "Viridian City".
    Add 8 to the row.
    Set Journey's row to the row.
    Set Journey's column to 0.
    Stop.
  If Journey's place is "Route 1" or Journey's place is "Route 22":
    If the ledge at the column by the row is yes:
      If Journey's facing is "south":
        Add 1 to the row.
      If Journey's facing is "west":
        Subtract 1 from the column.
      If Journey's facing is "east":
        Add 1 to the column.
  If the terrain at the column by the row is "wall":
    Stop.
  If the person at the column by the row is not "":
    Stop.
  Set Journey's column to the column.
  Set Journey's row to the row.
  Cross.
